64
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:57,680
to fetch the entire cache block.

65
00:04:57,680 --> 00:05:02,480
Of course, like cache design, this is only beneficial with spatial locality.

66
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:07,600
But the rate of improvement in DRAM speeds has been a lot slower than processor speeds,

67
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:11,440
